:: Analyst Brain [nobr agent analyst] {"position":"2400,1875","size":"100,100"}
<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "analystBrain">>
        <<speaker "Analyst">>
        Yes is the likely answer. The brain stress responses were suppressed in place of the environment change not being the deterministic factor.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "You">>
        And what does that even mean now? Am I still myself? Also, is this thing in my head harmful to me?
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Analyst">>
        No to both inquiries. The only side effect is  higher potential for amnesia. Is that something you want to research?
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[I don't remember anything.|Analyst No Memory]]
            [[I remember who I'm meant to be.|Analyst Who I Am]]
            [[Why even build something like this in my brain?|Analyst Why Build]]
        </div>
  <</ctp>>
</div>


:: Analyst Carry Know [nobr agent analyst] {"position":"3400,2425","size":"100,100"}
<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "analystCarryKnow">>
        <<speaker "Analyst">>
        Knowing without carrying. Awareness without weight. That is either a very advanced state or a very early one. We have not determined which end of that spectrum your kind occupies. Possibly neither. Possibly both depending on the individual. That variability is what makes classification difficult.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        The Analyst returns to its work.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[Exit the specimen bay.|Specimen Bay Exit]]
        </div>
  <</ctp>>
</div>


