    <<ctp "analystGreaterDesign">>
        <<speaker "Analyst">>
        Theories. Plural. Unresolved. Your species detected a pattern and produced multiple explanations. Each internally consistent. Each incompatible. Unresolved fundamentals should produce stillness. Yours don't. You build on them anyway. I am not certain whether that is an error or the most efficient behaviour we've observed.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        The biochip glitches lightly.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Analyst">>
            You said 'bundle'. Like it is something you carry. Do you?
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[I suppose I do. Everyone does, whether they admit it or not.|Analyst Carry Yes]]
            [[Not really. I just know it exists.|Analyst Carry Know]]
            [[I used to. Not so much anymore.|Analyst Carry Used To]]
            [[I don't think about it much.|Analyst Carry No]]
        </div>
  <</ctp>>
</div>


