:: Cart Brain Rage [nobr agent cartographer archive] {"position":"2800,775","size":"100,100"}
<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "cartBrainPermanent">>
        <<speaker "You">>
        But will it affect me in any other way? Is it permanent?
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Cartographer">>
        Permanent is unlikely.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        The intervention was narrow: stress acceleration, panic escalation, and overload response during transfer.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        It was not designed to change memory, personality, judgment, attachment, or belief.
