<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "discardedRoomFirst">>
        The discarded room sits off the Archive Bay, slightly recessed from the main chamber.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        There is no sign on the door. No label the biochip can translate. No warning from the ship.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        The door opens.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        Inside: dim air, cold metal, and the smell of something sterile failing to hide something dead.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        In the far corner, there is a body.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        Human.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        The narrator goes quiet.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        Not the reflective quiet he uses when he wants you to feel the weight of something.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        A different kind.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Narrator">>
        That shouldn't be there.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        I mean the body. Obviously the body.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        There was a person before you. Someone else who came through the same process.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        They didn't survive it. Their biochip malfunctioned. That part I knew.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        What I did not know was that they were in here.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        A beat.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        When he speaks again, he is too quick.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Narrator">>
        Believe me, there is nothing relevant in there. Come out. You still have signals to gather.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        The room is the same.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        The body is the same.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        But The Exception is standing here now, on the other side of the body, still enough to seem like part of the room.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Exception">>
        You found the previous pattern.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        The narrator says nothing.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[Who were they?|Discarded Who]]
            [[Did you do this?|Discarded Did You]]
            [[I don't want to be in here.|Discarded Leave]]
            [[Talk to Exception.|Discarded Exception]]
