:: Fusion Core Exception Variant [nobr core exception] {"position":"2800,5100","size":"100,100"}
<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "fusionCoreExceptionVariant">>
        The same chamber. The same heat and hum. But the person standing at the far end is not the narrator. The Exception stands in the Fusion Core the way it stands everywhere — as if it belongs there and has for longer than the room has existed.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Exception">>
        You came.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[Where is the narrator?|Burn Exception Narrator]]
            [[You led me here on purpose.|Burn Exception Led]]
            [[What do you want me to do?|Burn Exception What]]
        </div> 
