        The left control accepts your touch.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        Nothing opens.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        A low pressure tone moves through the chamber. The glass stays sealed, and the symbols around the frame begin to pulse in a rhythm you do not understand.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Narrator">>
