    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Narrator">>
        I talk through the system the aliens use for cases like this. I help translate, guide, warn, explain, and occasionally prevent you from walking directly into obvious disasters.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Narrator">>
        That is the useful answer.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        The voice pauses for just long enough to make the next sentence feel rehearsed.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Narrator">>
        The answer you're asking for is more basic. Alien, human, program, hallucination, parasite, ghost in the machine. You would not be irrational to consider any of those.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Narrator">>
        But the locked room ahead matters more than my biography.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        What both of us need is behind that door. The room is not part of their usual routine. It is an exception.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        Much like you.
