    <<ctpNext clear>>
        The Analyst is already present. It doesn't turn to face you.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Analyst">>
        New specimen has entered an active observation environment. Deviation from standard approach trajectory: 14%. Consistent with prior recorded behaviour from this specimen class. Continuing.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[Are you the colleague who messed with my brain?|Analyst Brain]]
			[[What exactly is this place?|Analyst What Place]]
			[[Are those things alive?|Analyst Alive]]
			[[You're studying me, aren't you?|Analyst Studying]]
			[[This is wrong.|Analyst Wrong]]
        </div>
  <</ctp>>
</div>


