:: Specimen Bay Exit [nobr missing-features specimen exception] {"position":"3600,2275","size":"100,100"}
<<hideAgent>>

<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "specimenBayExit">>
        <<speaker "Narrator">>
        You look like you just felt it again. It feels like a routine to you now.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        As you approach the exit, the Exception is standing in the doorway.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "You">>
        You scared the hell out of me!
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Exception">>
        Wasn't my intention. But I am here because you're here.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "You">>
        That's either sweet or unsettling. I haven't decided which.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Exception">>
        Both seem applicable. I've noticed your species often experiences them simultaneously and calls it something else entirely.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "You">>
        Do you want something or?
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Exception">>
        No. I was observing the room you came from.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Exception">>
        Your intent lacks resolve.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[Talk to the exception further.|Specimen Bay Exception]]
            [["I'm fine. Just keep moving."|Pre Control Room]]
        </div>
  <</ctp>>
</div>


