})();
<</script>>


:: Successful Artifact Ending [nobr ending artifactsuccess] {"position":"5200,3300","size":"100,100"}
<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "successfulArtifactEnding">>
        You emit the Exception's signal before approaching the door. It travels through the ship's own systems. The control room receives it. The narrator does not.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        The door opens. The narrator is standing, as prepared as before. But the biochip disorientation is different — the security reduction has altered the frequency. His monitoring of your precise position is degraded.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        You move. The narrator reacts — half a second late. They collide. The narrator goes down.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        The biochip, overwhelmed by the frequency collision, fails entirely. Silence in your skull for the first time since the awakening chamber.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Narrator">>
        The signal. That was— that wasn't the biochip.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        He understands. It takes him three seconds.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Narrator">>
        The Exception. It gave you a signal I couldn't hear. It knew about the blind spot. It's been on this ship since launch and it knew about the— how long has it known?
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        He laughs. The laugh of a person who has just found out they were outplayed by something they dismissed.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Narrator">>
        I thought it was furniture. I was spectacularly wrong about that.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[It's been watching you the whole time.|Artifact End Watch]]
            [[It wanted this outcome.|Artifact End Wanted]]
            [[You should have known it was important.|Artifact End Should]]
        </div> 
  <</ctp>>
</div>


